# Optional site-specific AI agent notes (/etc/agents/site.md)
#
# Copy to /etc/agents/site.md inside your site's Warewulf overlay or host /etc
# (bind-mounted read-only into login pods when present) to give coding agents
# accurate local cluster facts without editing the generic AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md.
#
# Example:
#
# ## Site Cluster Facts
# - **Cluster**: example-cluster
# - **Login pod limits**: 4 CPUs, 4 GB RAM, 7-day walltime
# - **Partitions**: `compute` (default, 60-min default walltime)
# - **GPUs**: `--gres=gpu:l40s:1` (full GPU)
# - **Open OnDemand**: https://ondemand.example.edu
# - **Support**: support@example.edu
